   --------------------------------------------------------------------------
   --- Derived equations of <seed-equation> by <proof-score-id>
   --------------------------------------------------------------------------

   rl [derivedequationsof-no-data] :
      < cafeInMaude : CIM | state: executeComm,
         input: 'derived`equations`of_by_.['neTokenList[T], 'neTokenList[T2]],
